---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<div class="trio">
  <div>
    <span class="tile">
      <Icon name="shield" />
    </span>
    <h3>Private by design</h3>
    <p>
      Your browser does the work. The site is locked so it can't send files
      anywhere, and you can check that in the Network tab.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <span class="tile">
      <Icon name="zap" />
    </span>
    <h3>No waiting</h3>
    <p>
      No upload, no queue, no download step. A typical photo is done in well
      under a second.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <span class="tile">
      <Icon name="offline" />
    </span>
    <h3>Keeps working offline</h3>
    <p>
      Once a tool has loaded, it doesn't need a connection to process your
      files.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
